    "description": "<p><em>Weapon (Any Simple or Martial), Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>As long as this weapon is within your reach and you are attuned to it, you and allies within 30 feet of you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Alarm.</strong> The weapon magically awakens each subject who is sleeping naturally when combat begins. This benefit doesn't wake a subject from magically induced sleep.</p><p><strong>Supernatural Readiness.</strong> Each subject has Advantage on its Initiative rolls.</p><p></p>",
